WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
Rival

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.920
Protagonist

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.410
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.950
I was taken to this place

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:14.140
called the Digital World,

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:17.400
where I met Shoutmon and 
lots of other Digimon.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:22.500
This world is having a lot of trouble 
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.560
We finally claimed the 
symbol of the Island Zone,

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.590
the Code Crown,

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.380
but the fearsome Ebidramon 
was waiting for us.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.630
I obtained the data of 
some legendary Digimon

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.450
and summoned Leviamon.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.030
Thankfully we defeated Ebidramon, but...

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.010
Now the island is surrounded 
by the Bagra Army,

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.830
and we're in a desperate situation!

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:21.960
<b>X4 Breaks Through the Crisis!</b>

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:17.720
X4 Breaks Through the Crisis!

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:42.580
Very good.

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:45.990
That's the way, MailBirdramon.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:49.850
My, what stunning strength.

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.160
What do you want?

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.650
The boy with the red Xros Loader

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.830
has acquired another Code Crown.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.850
Just as I thought.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.010
He is rather capable.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:04.020
He also has the DigiMemories.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.210
DigiMemories?

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:09.530
Those things said to hold the 
data of legendary Digimon?

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.780
But it looks like he's in a little trouble now.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.550
MailBirdramon, go ahead and finish him off.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.640
We're surrounded!

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.710
Can't go fishing or even take a nap.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.680
These guys are ticking me off.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:51.080
I should call Leviamon again...

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:53.420
What?

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:55.750
Leviamon has turned black!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:59.440
I can't use a DigiMemory more than once?

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.430
A warning to the humans.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:04.980
You are completely surrounded.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.570
Don't bother trying to resist.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:13.680
It's as if we're the bad guys...

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.930
Hand over the Code Crown and 
DigiMemories immediately.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.360
Who would—

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.220
That's it!

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.310
We got the Code Crown,

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.530
so we can go to the next Zone, right?

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.230
Why don't we just hightail 
it out of here now?

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.320
Oh, yeah!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:29.120
No!

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.820
Why not?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.760
Hand them over without a fuss,

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.750
or he dies.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.290
Archelomon!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.170
That's really low!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:44.620
Now, throw the Code 
Crown and DigiMemories

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.640
to the Seadramon.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.710
Fail to comply, and he dies!

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.030
Don't worry about me.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.050
Get to the next Zone, quickly!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:02.150
I know you all can save 
the Digital World.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:07.060
We can entrust the future 
of our world to you.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:08.960
Silence!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.640
He's right.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.680
Sir Archelomon is right.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.430
I want you to use the Code 
Crown and DigiMemories,

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.970
not to control this world,

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:25.110
but to save it.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.640
ChibiKamemon...

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.240
Wait a minute!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:31.580
Are you saying we should let 
Archelomon die just for that?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.510
ChibiKamemon may be right.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.500
At any rate,

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.160
as long as this island is 
surrounded, there's no escape,

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.930
let alone any means of 
rescuing Archelomon.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.100
Taiki...

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.230
Please go! Hurry!

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.670
How can I do that?!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:56.180
If we run away now, Archelomon will die!

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.600
And there's no telling

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.450
what might happen to 
everyone on the island!

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.820
I can't run away and abandon them!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.850
But...

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:07.000
I'm following Taiki.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:11.520
Taiki's our General, after all!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.740
Shoutmon...

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:15.890
What's the problem? Hurry it up!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:24.140
Taiki, I think you should 
do what you think is best.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.320
Same here.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.210
Akari... Zenjirou...

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.170
I know you don't

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:34.380
want to sacrifice someone else 
to save yourself, right?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.310
We understand.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.450
We're a team, after all.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.430
Thank you...

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:45.960
I'm tired of waiting, humans!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.390
I accept your demands!

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.100
Let Archelomon go!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.510
Very well.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:58.270
Throw them this way and I will 
let him leave this ship.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:00.440
Make it quick!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.590
Throw them to the Seadramon!

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.250
Lord Tactimon will be pleased.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.500
Kiriha!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:25.330
Looks like you're in a 
pretty serious situation.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.900
Go, MailBirdramon!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.380
How about it?

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:42.900
I'll crush the Bagra Army for you...

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.360
if you give me the DigiMemories.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.060
What's your deal?!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.820
Forget about bargaining and just help us!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:51.930
That's right!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:55.040
Humans should work together 
at times like this!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.490
What are you doing?!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.400
Do you not care what 
happens to his life?!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.570
Well? What'll it be?

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.640
I won't accept your help.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.980
I won't accept help from 
someone who can't understand

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:14.010
the value of a life.

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:20.220
But, I do owe you my thanks.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:25.190
You reduced their forces a bit.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.630
I see. But what will you do?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.100
There are still many enemies left.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.370
You're going to use a DigiMemory?

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.980
Is this a sea Digimon?

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:42.610
<b>MarineAngemon</b>

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:42.610
<b>Attack:</b>

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:42.610
<b>Ocean Love</b>

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.340
MarineAngemon...

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.610
How cute!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.930
That's a legendary Digimon?

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.580
We have no choice!

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:48.810
DigiMemory!

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:56.920
Ocean Love, activate!

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.100
Love...?

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.090
"I want to love, 
more than to be loved..."

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:04.290
Love!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.370
Love, love, love...

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.100
Love!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.310
So Ocean Love is...

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.640
Love!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:20.650
...an attack that bewitches 
all opponents?

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.810
Love is amazing...

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.680
Now's our chance to rescue Archelomon!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.190
But how do we get all the way out there?

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:32.140
Shakomon, I need to ask you a favor.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.490
Round up some more of 
your fellow Shakomon.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.070
They made a bridge!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.510
I get it.

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:43.770
Okay, let's go!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.700
Shoutmon!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.840
Ballistamon!

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.070
DigiXros!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:56.360
Shoutmon!

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:00.390
Ballistamon!

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.990
DigiXros!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.950
Shoutmon X2!

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:21.640
Starmon!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.340
Pickmons!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.780
DigiXros!

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:27.130
Starmon!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:30.600
Pickmons!

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:35.320
Banana Boat!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:39.030
Rare Star Sword!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.310
I'm going, too!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.030
Okay!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.670
Be careful, guys!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:00.960
Taiki Kudou is indeed 
an interesting guy.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.800
He very handily uses

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:05.650
any means available 
to overcome obstacles.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.710
Taiki has been helping 
lots of different clubs.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:14.560
That might be why he can adapt 
so well to any situation.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:15.710
I see.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:19.530
But the thing he'll need 
in the end is strength.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:27.950
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.680
They may be made up of data,

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:35.020
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.130
Join us in our world of adventure

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.250
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.320
DigiXros!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.220
Shakomon, open your shell!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:25.490
Zenjirou, take care of Archelomon!

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.860
Got it!

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.160
Shinonome Single Slice!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.370
Fools!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.800
Have you come to die?!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:44.460
All right!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.370
Once we've saved Archelomon,

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.880
we have no reason to stick around!

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:49.780
Everyone, time to retreat!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.960
You won't get away!

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:04.400
Seadramon! Use Ice Arrow!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:21.630
Now, how shall I finish you off?

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.250
Pierce you with my spear?

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:27.090
Or just let you freeze to death?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.150
It's no use...

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.360
I can't move...

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.190
I will eliminate you

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:35.040
and take the DigiMemories 
and Code Crown.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:43.870
Dorulumon!

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:53.040
Dorulumon, you came to help us?

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.260
Those Bagra Army jerks

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.510
butted in when I was 
relaxing by the sea.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:14:00.210
It made me mad.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.530
Fools!

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.410
Adding one more to your 
ranks will change nothing!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.060
I will slay you all!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.760
Shoutmon!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.800
Ballistamon!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.830
Dorulumon!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:17.770
DigiXros!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:25.300
Shoutmon!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.280
Ballistamon!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.910
Dorulumon!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.960
DigiXros!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:10.320
Shoutmon X3!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.060
Starmon!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.600
Pickmons!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.030
DigiXros!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.410
Starmon!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.400
Pickmons!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.410
Shoutmon X4!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.060
No amount of struggling will save you!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.620
Go, Shoutmon X4!

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:52.760
Right!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.530
Vortex Penetrate!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:03.780
What?!

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:06.980
That's my sentient spear, King's Bite.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:10.210
It will continue to attack until 
it has pierced the enemy.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.600
This is not good!

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.840
At this rate,

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.520
he'll run out of energy while 
that spear keeps attacking!

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:23.670
Then you should use the 
spear's program against him.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:27.130
I get it!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.440
Shoutmon X4! Dive into the sea!

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.800
Without ChibiKamemon?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:34.470
I have a plan!

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.140
All right!

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.210
It's no use.

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:46.020
Wherever you go, it'll follow you!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:47.850
Now!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.630
You...

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.410
What?!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:04.000
It's no use! Such a trick 
won't work on m—

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:17.520
W-Well played, King's Bite...

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:22.480
But Neptunemon won't 
die without a fight!

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:25.160
Wave of Depth!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:41.340
Everyone on the island, 
grab something and hold on tight.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.130
It seems to have stopped.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.970
Wait! What about Taiki and the others?

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.940
You're all safe!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.060
Thank goodness!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.090
It truly is a relief.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:45.600
We're saved, thanks 
to you... Ta... Ta...

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.300
Tai...

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.810
Ah, that's right! Taiyaki!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:50.810
It's Taiki!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:51.990
Oh, just go with it.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.110
Taiyaki sounds much 
more delicious anyway.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:19:00.010
We will continue to protect this 
island along with Master Whamon.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.790
Now we can finally begin 
the Summer Festival.

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:09.190
All right! Let's go all out!

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.480
I'm good at the Lantern Festival dance!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.130
That's not even close.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.670
I'm not sure why, 
but this is really fun!

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:22.290
All right! I'll dance, too!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.410
You're not going to steal 
the treasures from him?

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.810
I can do that anytime.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.540
Right now, I want his 
powers more than ever.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:39.190
His strength to overcome adversity, 
and his recklessness.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.990
But the time may come when 
you'll have to fight him.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:47.800
I'll keep building up my 
own power until then.

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.380
The Island Zone has also been taken,

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.350
and Neptunemon defeated?

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.170
Annoying insects.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:06.220
I swear, I will crush you.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.020
Well, ready to go?

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:08.750
Yeah!

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.940
I want to go with you.

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:11.460
Huh?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:15.630
He says he wants to join Xros Heart.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.560
What?!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:21.130
He can, can't he, Taiki?

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.400
Of course!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.130
Yay!

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.020
That's great, ChibiKamemon!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.820
Dorulumon!

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.620
Become one of our friends 
in Xros Heart, too!

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:47.660
We need you!

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:49.090
I don't need friends.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.300
I'm not interested in being bound to anyone.

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:56.190
Dorulumon...

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.670
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:01.910
<b>Monitamon's Lovely♥ Enemy Search</b>

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.910
Searching for enemy data.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.130
Cutemon.

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:05.350
Attacks include... Um, well...

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:11.680
<b>[Type]

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:11.680
<b>Fairy Type</b>

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:09.640
Making opponents fall in 
love with his cuteness?

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.540
Ah, so in love...

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.120
You just made that up, didn't you?!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.550
<b>Fairy Ty</b>

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.390
The next Zone is a volcanic area!

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:18.520
We're being attacked by

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.270
a Digimon that burns up 
everything around him!

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.760
If we don't stop it, 
we'll be burned to ashes, too!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.300
Dorulumon, now is the time we 
really need your strength!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.730
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.470
<b>A Volcanic Digimon's Big Explosion!</b>

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.470
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
